## Objective

Detect accounts experiencing repeated Windows authentication failures within a short period.

The detection is intended to identify behavior that may represent:

- Brute-force authentication attempts
- Password guessing
- Unauthorized credential testing
- Misconfigured applications
- Stale credentials
- Abnormal authentication activity

A detection does not by itself establish malicious intent.

Analyst investigation is required to determine the cause and context of the authentication failures.

