## Detection Logic

DET-002 identifies accounts generating at least five failed authentication events during the configured five-minute detection window.

```spl
index=* EventCode=4625 earliest=-5m
| stats count as failures by TargetUserName
| where failures>=5
```

### Portfolio Output

```spl
index=* EventCode=4625 earliest=-5m
| stats count as failures by TargetUserName
| where failures>=5
| eval detection="DET-002 - Repeated Failed Authentication"
| table detection TargetUserName failures
```

