## Analyst Triage

When DET-002 triggers:

```text
DET-002
   |
   v
Identify TargetUserName
   |
   v
Review Failure Count
   |
   v
Identify Source
   |
   v
Review Logon Type
   |
   v
Review Failure Reason
   |
   v
Search Successful Logons
   |
   v
Review Related Activity
   |
   v
Determine Context
```

The analyst should determine:

1. Which account was targeted?
2. How many failures occurred?
3. How quickly did they occur?
4. Which host or IP generated them?
5. What logon type was involved?
6. What was the failure reason?
7. Were multiple accounts targeted?
8. Did authentication eventually succeed?
9. Is the source expected?
10. Is there related suspicious activity?

