## Successful Authentication Correlation

A particularly important investigation is determining whether failed authentication was followed by a successful logon.

Search:

```spl
index=* (EventCode=4624 OR EventCode=4625)
```

Then filter for the affected account using the appropriate username field.

Behavior of interest:

```text
4625
4625
4625
4625
4625
  |
  v
4624
```

Repeated failures followed by successful authentication may warrant increased investigation priority.

---

## Multiple-Account Analysis

An analyst can review which accounts are receiving the highest volume of failed authentication attempts:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4625
| stats count as failures by TargetUserName
| sort - failures
```

This can help distinguish activity against a single account from broader authentication activity affecting multiple accounts.

